=== Algorithm: numpy SSC with 2-prime CRT ===
See 04-computation/alpha_full_ssc_numpy.py
Key insight: (P1-1)² ≈ 4.6×10¹⁸ < int64 max → products fit in int64 before mod.
All hot loops vectorized as (n+1)×N/2 numpy array operations.
Speedup over pure Python: ~100× (pure Python timed out; numpy: ~41s/call).
